  "Experimental: custom gestures haven't been tested much. They may not be recognised reliably, and some two-finger actions in apps (scrolling, moving a map) may set one off by mistake. Shapes with a few clear turns work best.": "实验功能：自定义手势尚未充分测试，可能存在识别不稳定的情况，且部分双指操作（如滚动或拖动地图）可能误触发。带有几个明显转折的图形识别效果最好。",
