  "Give it a name": "请输入名称",
  "A bit bigger, please — draw that one again.": "画得太小了 — 请再大一点重画。",
  "Straight lines are taken as scrolling. Draw a shape with a turn in it.": "直线会被当作滚动，请绘制带转折的图形。",
  "Got it. Again.": "已记录，请再画一次。",
  "Looks distinct from the other gestures. Save it.": "与其他手势区分明显，可以保存。",
  "Saved, but it can't be used with one finger: it isn't a closed shape": "已保存，但无法用于单指：非闭合图形",
  "A cross is two quick diagonal strokes, which is exactly what two flicks look like while scrolling a feed or moving a map. With one finger it would go off by itself.": "交叉线与快速双滑极其相似，单指绘制容易频繁误触。",
  "This is two straight lines with one corner. Ordinary drags, swipes between photos and the back gesture draw that shape all the time, so with one finger it would go off by itself.": "折线与返回手势或切图滑动过于相似，单指模式下极易误触。",
  "Part of this digit is an open line, and a scroll that curls at the end can look just like it. With one finger it would go off by itself.": "该数字包含开口线条，单指带弧度滚动时容易误触。",
  "A one-finger swipe is how every app scrolls.": "单指滑动用于所有应用的日常滚动。",
  "This digit is an open line that doesn't end where it starts. A curved scroll or swipe in an app can draw the same shape, so with one finger it would go off by itself.": "此数字不是闭合图形，单指操作时很容易与普通滑动混淆。",
